{
  "name": "Competitor Google Search & YouTube Ad Spy Automation (Google Ads Transparency)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Competitor Google Search & YouTube Ad Spy Automation (Google Ads Transparency)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack active Google Search, YouTube, and Display ad creatives run by any competitor domain via the Google Ads Transparency Center.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/google-ads-transparency-center-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/google-ads-transparency-center-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Google Ads Transparency Center Scraper API** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "4e3fd8b9-2d92-45f7-a327-8d0a8cbf307f",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Google Ads Transparency Center Scraper API** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "ab908ae4-b936-4735-aa07-591e1becac58",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "8559d4e5-cee3-4128-a3b4-bd32af5b5bf9",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9daad957-9c6b-4ac0-a92b-8d96cb81a521",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e6f2d263-9187-4489-a36a-8a3c3f8b759a",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"hubspot.com\",\"monday.com\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "63b366ea-8883-4624-a686-8db7c7b6308a",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b611d9d7-61b2-4f79-a313-607e3c8d3559",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "Ad Spy & SEO",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cf0a3343-d4fb-4664-a480-bfa1ffb09a8e",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
